 ],
 "notes": "Parameter names are not stated, so matched by default value. A query grouping by authentication type or method is accepted as covering all three methods, since it reports each of them; otherwise each of AD/SAML, Mutual Auth and Mixed Auth must be named in a query. Log group parameters defaulting to another path (e.g. /aws/client-vpn/prod) fail log_group_param because the prompt states the default."
